<title>POLAND: ELEKTROBUDOWA OCT NET FALLS TO PLN 0.9 MLN.</title>
<headline>ELEKTROBUDOWA OCT NET FALLS TO PLN 0.9 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results October</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>OCTOBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.90 vs   0.96</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 1.78 vs   1.64</p>
<p> Operating profit     2.12 vs   2.07</p>
<p> Sales		   19.64 vs  17.89</p>
<p>JANUARY-OCTOBER</p>
<p> Net profit	    12.60 vs   7.89</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	22.79 vs  12.87</p>
<p> Operating profit    24.54 vs  15.26</p>
<p> Sales		  183.55 vs 134.38</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish construction company is</p>
<p>Elektrobudowa SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
